==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{m|la|proximatus}}, past participle of {{m|la|proximare||to draw near, approach}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|proximus||nearest}}, superlative of {{m|la|prope||near}}.

